es the next Basic Attack - Present Self Stage 3, which now restores 100 points of Dedication when cast. Switching to another Resonator ends this effect.\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} or hold Normal Attack within a certain period after casting this skill to perform Basic Attack - Present Self Stage 3.\n\nWhile in Foreclaimed Self, Resonance Skill - Present Self is replaced by Frostblight: Jade Cleave and Frostblight: Petalfall:\n\nFrostblight: Jade Cleave\nWhile on the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to pull in nearby targets and deal Glacio DMG, removing the targets' Frostbind.\nThis skill shares a Cooldown with Frostblight: Petalfall.\n\nFrostblight: Petalfall\nWhile in mid-air, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to pull in nearby targets and deal Glacio DMG, removing the targets' Frostbind.\nThis skill shares a Cooldown with Frostblight: Jade Cleave.","rows":[{"name":"Resonance Skill - Present Self DMG","mult":[{"kind":"pct","hits":[[12.32,4],[49.28,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[13.34,4],[53.33,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[14.35,4],[57.37,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[15.76,4],[63.02,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[16.77,4],[67.07,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[17.93,4],[71.71,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[19.55,4],[78.18,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[21.16,4],[84.64,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[22.78,4],[91.11,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[24.5,4],[97.98,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[26.52,4],[106.06,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[28.54,4],[114.14,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[30.56,4],[122.22,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[32.58,4],[130.31,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[34.6,4],[138.39,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[36.62,4],[146.47,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[38.64,4],[154.55,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[40.66,4],[162.63,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[42.68,4],[170.72,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[44.7,4],[178.8,1]]}],"extra":[]},{"name":"Frostblight: Jade Cleave DMG","mult":[{"kind":"pct","hits":[[33.2,4]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":